		(uuid "2140c647-af5e-492a-a4cd-61f349d2c020")
	)
	(text "NOTES\n\n1.  R1-R8 are LED current-limiting resistors. Prototype values are intentionally \n    varied in pairs for brightness/current evaluation: \n    R1-R2 = 220 Ω, R3-R4 = 330 Ω, R5-R6 = 470 Ω, R7-R8 = 680 Ω. \n    Final production value TBD after visual comparison with the existing Yahrzeit Wall.\n2.  J1/J2 are +5 V power in/out.\n3.  J3/J4 preserve the legacy YYZ-PIXEL signal-cable pinout for drop-in compatibility.\n4.  U1 unused inputs A1/A3/A5/A7 are tied to GND intentionally.\n5.  LED polarity: resistor side = anode; 74HC595 side = cathode.\n6.  C2 and C3 are local 0.1 µF decoupling capacitors and should be placed close to \n    U1 and U2 respectively."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.862 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8d19d2af-c2a5-4231-aab5-8ecf5f762d10")
	)
